{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1469,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1466e2ab1fec5ba66fdf1e98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再忙也要好好吃饭喔。\r\n因为用餐除了营养以外，\r\n还能一并摄取运气呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b72f2f49942dbdc4f18b01216b2c824c0c6719744b1f0a41d0d51bb9985ac546",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5bc64dd182e2143b1a1ac59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食堂的菜单设计得\r\n非常平衡呢！应该是了解\r\n「饮食风水」的人设计的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f55fdaa9a21d98c518f4855b0c4036a35f16e1ce1d1cbebb57624ae8ae4245a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9646c7638c05eee54e9ff4bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好泡澡、\r\n好好睡觉。\r\n这就是摆脱不好的气的秘诀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11bf0cd9e23cb327d6f0659d3ae4c0a7dddaf6ede33236ff06fa96a7eccc4757",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b5a3be26774c46246308b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在一决胜负前，可以把枕头朝东，\r\n再穿红色睡衣睡觉！这对比赛、\r\n考试和恋爱……都非常有效喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb38691da4d770e37cd325cfa481611b03a7a7bf08b3077733fe37f001a69fa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb279ce57521c12b9416dfc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生和社会新鲜人都充满了阳气，\r\n所以看着他们就能变Happy！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27a09fc3ad33381a6084f8bb4c785562bf5deb93787625e695b7725dce3ba8bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52b05ce7b34aae091b1fc0bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天就会想去海边大玩特玩！\r\n冲走厄运的海浪，带来邂逅的\r\n海风──这些都能补充好运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f6612e6d05a8a377c50ef96b69cb305498785d98d12685cb8c36e9e89c9811e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71864b6720c4848cad26a22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要换新钱包，推荐在秋天☆\r\n这样你的钱包就会变成\r\n能累积财富的「丰收钱包」喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f067d9409aa8b6a22fb5951e59d62df18e678c98557b07adcc6e0cd024f39df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33eba0c4a4fc197ea8b10181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的水之气非常多，\r\n要小心别感冒喔。\r\n多带一点暖色系的东西在身上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6440c613645f5c30e06008eab8e37b97bee82e3766712c80e6a9d90fb74b29d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a18dfb30445066c264a05071",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今早的手帕……我推荐绿色！\n袜子就选能提升胜负运的红色！\n这样绝对能一整天Happy☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e2bd669b0009a76052959cd1dd5a1dac4534adcf13ec0b6e0b6beace621503",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1da9320181b6c02579c741a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从风水来说早起很关键……但是，\n就算叫醒希城同学她也会说着\n『冷死了』然后躺回床上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73305f3b88e29d8b377221314ec992929d0cd2a447892f03d5d65eab576086fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e940bb053964f9cc3039a2da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暖呼呼的阳光……眼睛……慢慢闭上\n……啊！你也想睡午觉了！？\n得有合适的垫子和枕头，还有朝向！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14eefdc9d6cc70330eacb3d1da5bdaff576fa6d8c1f93bc95cba51d86795263",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:966c96a5416de9ee7b1a763c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午饭时也想招来好运呢。\n首先要把食堂筷子改成金色……好！\n得去全力说服气槽学姐了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78aa110a1bc9517b7781448c127b5f9a2de4e64ab6baad876ba855b4a40e6cc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ae77cc622bb7b054822279c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算累了晚上也得洗澡！\n把汗水和厄运排走，再按按腿……\n幸运会寄宿在健康的身体里哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c4986d3a5f782529870f3d742fef967d5f2852d28eb507274f67e9e1761344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c33f7492a9470dbe3c4eaa08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼~！今天我们都辛苦了☆\n让内心舒缓下来，用白色枕头\n放松身心……祝愿今晚也有好梦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c59934317960da1a1b9cf0b3f254a16f74588d76f4bfd55add9cfab78477b141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec068ca10320f2ef7fffd82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天，就想到黄莺和云雀！\n毕竟小鸟可是幸运的搬运工呢♪\n真希望能给大家带来幸福啊~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a083c5295884f66c4f89aaa7d97fea1fe6e96288205b30f7879905fe7215500",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f81d7b79289056805580f95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "音乐和风水有很深的关系呢☆\n有种叫声音风水的……对了！\n我们去听听夏天大自然的声音吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bdf8c3a61fb61e364c437322972ad89aadb3941ece973bb80fa52eeb903139f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eadad05a68204d86ddfae8e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想用风水让房间开心的话，\n播放古典音乐是个不错的选择☆\n让『月光』流淌在漫漫秋夜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d12a6d22d804c9e8a96c34ad37e00816bbee9be5d073e08ea7f8c7116cc53a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:479ed1df4c3a93214c5ecae2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天时大家都会迷上奇锐骏同学的\n南瓜派呢！把健康运金钱运……\n还有满满的爱意紧紧抱住☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7584fa5574ebf48070d886682cfdc7c47974a7b180327b034cc76940d92c8260",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaa96c76c34bc5f59e2b9b99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab75641234eb92578f96bb4f99aab9c2ec0716fb0943e8e752e2141a30a90be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14115662ecc0ceda7cb9b433",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab75641234eb92578f96bb4f99aab9c2ec0716fb0943e8e752e2141a30a90be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33febcbc7b8ad7e3b1c802cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火燃烧后会产生灰土──\r\n火山与我「相生」，\r\n是我的好对手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9a031385484874a36a090f64a80a7ef78de79c84c40eb0edee9355d770efc32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc87c8f96c2a318daf33a4a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水能浇熄火焰──\r\n锐骏与我「相克」。\r\n感觉比赛时会成为难缠的对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72b0c82ffdc9ba5b3f6666917e1edb552940417c54a3e7ebfd15e7a1e1b502ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0694219304164a08954d9ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子之前问我要不要当当看\r\n「风水系赛马娘偶像」！\r\n为了推广风水，或许可行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fdc90d9b0e37a0c795d9ad38e121ac20566a7f975537ef45f38d2141079fd1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca63175f609c50e2d2c03be7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风水以外擅长的事情？\r\n嗯～照顾小孩子吧。\r\n毕竟我是长女嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1634c9ffef4dea9dc7f1f08469ffdc0005df7b8f5721d985a238fecd9df08a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcab9fd3fda258b011d912a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风水是透过统计得出的环境哲学！\r\n神宫也表示说\r\n「嗯，还算是合乎逻辑」喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f8bc5e9807a08a9d7bfac8a593cc57a0912ec902097266ef21660da45cbe58f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614b6a10961e409108df37f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆\r\nHappy live☆\r\n歌曲也能带来幸运喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7801ca25d27a37ef1f3ffd9abeb8a19f12ffd9771d34f794f0ffb5479ec1aa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb439342fdf500e4b3071988",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用白色补充金之气，用紫色达成\r\n相生……这套服装搭配得不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d929b60ad1c96773246d060feb650e734bff2aef0914af74648eb58d6f581dd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:718294add4843a0799fe08b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿能驱散厄运、招来福气！──\r\n这件决胜服里就蕴含着\r\n我的这一番心愿喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bca04ebdcd05e912bc529c74ced3a1e120ebc1cae3b6be399ef68c230050145",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30c34ed277ce991e0e1369c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主要颜色是happy的黄色！\r\n虽然也考虑过代表胜负运的红色，\r\n但我想带给大家的是幸运嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bf55f9c98bde800dbe3ba1d87e0024289620ca5ee133581e5e54aa8f3520528",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b30218e620c07d5ceb4375",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨是一天的开始，\r\n也是决定当天运势的时间！\r\n必须好好整顿环境！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76458bb81def73dd34f7c699be0e08579b520119fb9b011bbb2e8edb35bc0e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdd25945c308adab2f4d4f16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微睡个午觉吧。\r\n与宿舍床铺的方位反方向，\r\n调整阴与阳的平衡……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a88b1c3334ad0ea903f0f75db55d02443a254905698c423ce4c32259c420be3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71d886fc97d5c435f07e527b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对决？好呀！\n风水的神奇之处，\n就让你好好见识一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8cccf1462c68f72b391e6f77104927021b284105998b211a8d3df81f55922f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc7475e310f7bb47f477f81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鬼怪吗？我是不怎么害怕。\r\n因为只要把祂当成是一种灾厄，\r\n就能靠风水拟定对策了嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44f1b6dc2cbcd2130f90d1d9cd38a3027dc8f80ecda3c514ec3a63f552478655",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:774586faf2a32c45dd00c535",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赏花～赏花～♪\r\n我今年也要去欣赏每年都会去看的\r\n那株樱花，好好赏满三次！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de44d95b15f970910046db06e4e15ae6f5bb656d3a0d28af2a22914543c1ae17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2e31d99d4e4544c4f0b283",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以把出入口的门稍微打开一点吗？\r\n我想让凉风和好的气进来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "feac34adbc1b18329cf3ef682caa48650421cd04889f2d254be7a7ca25d67aea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b65ad81ae77225b2b2499c7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "柿子、栗子、秋刀鱼和番薯！\r\n秋天的美食充满了好的气，\r\n让人欲罢不能呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1c754db599473e1f121e4bc5fa1ca59afdd6d0dfbd08d4b3b74bfbec4a4afe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21f211a6f2887228fa723acb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论雪下得多大，火山都很有精神，\r\n气的流向也非常稳定！\r\n在天气冷的时候，还满令人羡慕的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2c9c7226ddf6be316c2c8d873121e26c19c16ab1df24491687e77d1d7b4714f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:282c36aa6b825614ba0f7a71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我猜中了创升的烦恼，\n接着她问我『你是哪里知道的情报』\n哼哼，是风水告诉我的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c04a0119daa5b161c0d21662b9c41cbadd247d20ba3cf2ce24e7dbf3c8f3e893",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:635e4c34eae7032c14135425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个那个，你有乐器吗？\n要放的话……就放在房间东边吧！\n说不定会有好东西轻轻飘来哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf363a6d0bd4eaec27d5e3f9f9089d33feb7623fe27bdb22f9ca5af7cdeda91a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd362b003c808d56a918d484",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪亮的饰品、红色的决胜服。\n每次说“希城同学风水满分☆”时\n她都会发火说“才没有”呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0ed0809d0f4cfe45b956aed3f953b36b64e8cdf0f7b1899d42d9a34f11d496b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:468c5d946d3c846da66ca9f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的点心……和奇锐骏同学\n两个人，一起吃煎饼！配着茶一起\n脆脆地咬上一口，满满胜负运~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "05206282f4c07fe3fbe3cb495e477d7d874f54fbdc4c6daa3849097e90eab8ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b994d586cb42bc9469890358",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子的声音很打动人心呢！\n我能不能也用歌声传播风水呢？\n『心动跃动 把幸运传播~♪』",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb38895a16a9897a9777650df94c1793ca81c4e174034c509bfa96a2c45f3fc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:711d80986a272fffe1638402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的幸运食物就决定是\n星鳗和海鳗了♪\n白烧和蒲烧我都要试一下☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "194055ba142ce1cac2340749b1f4c9266d6077636f5d07781769a40d6c48d4e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd7dec9176df7316ee73a82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想改造一下食堂入口啊~！\n地垫颜色还有花的种类什么的……\n都让我来布置一下吧~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d46260dc89864689879f512b147b94f786f90d59a21f8f4bb7017202b65fd0e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf4e4cae17cb709d0ae279d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上打开窗户想换换气的时候，\n偶尔会听见地方歌谣传进来。\n……火山她很努力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8592582746b67564bbdc0744d03dea2bef443939f29fa5f972905bd3446f48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc419458ce0d2c9a8fc878bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离别会带来新的邂逅——\n就像不间断的音乐一样。\n祝愿你被气运温柔眷顾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c675dba97e1e60ad67b0da83ecb17e5948a1c62e5f9af8caf09a9fb336003945",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a46bfd5bac5ecc51e6e8166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子说，要去参加夏日庆典\n寻找演出灵感~！\n感觉她会得到满满的大地之力呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fec143e1d826c3e51578f4c3d47d16757ffe8202248b2c9b9d5dd2846ac1239b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e5fecf8e38cd08670b5ec60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃秋味太上头的人呀……\n悄悄教你一招，风水减肥！\n悄悄地感谢悄悄地沾上好运☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "25aa4810f86229cae205fa04f8007a1b53bcb8054952329e8f1223e1de871614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f29bccfe5dc2ef365209b45e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天冷了就喝蚬子味噌汤！\n防感冒加才能UP的风水秘术……\n咦？芭蕾同学也很熟悉风水吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a07d2eb3df3a1ff44c4c40b4bba78886d5c96bc8d1f036804a49697d2d33441c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1ffbe1f35984808a59a1ecd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想锻炼直觉就穿华丽衣服……没错，\n就是能在黑黑的房间里发光的那种！\n和飞鹰子一起就是双重风水☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "faf831ea7b31fd3d5ecaa9ac0b116868c9040a2571fc20a19b873d8c98207fce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b84c466aea12c2381380df4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？八角形是八方位的象征。\n很吉利哦！这件衣服上Copa地藏有\n这种图案……来找找看吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a0eb2d5e68bc6ea5dd7f6eeb84b4ef40f09502a4e7923326d4d924969599a4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80508780f898b87238e0f302",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从我的房间看出去的吉位在这边！\r\n在这训练一定会很有效果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47e2a9090de7787cb8b3350bac8b732465caed4842c5e381f59c57edf4b6fbd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d13122c917efa68b439dda24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cca6b23a11354d81064b55655ba4a571b6f902dbe2c6b2ff8852bd9068bc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d1415a904efcfccb18e61b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好很好！\r\n这个训练内容，\r\n感觉能吸引许多阳气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "333833cadd6c191d37a9bdb28303d7156eeca0684a72d37048d7422ff9f6c67b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29b971a195d840a1e98e860",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆\r\nCopaCopa的开运训练，\r\n要开始啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4796f72a69b530536c1799b31a53279aa4b8ebfe53b82d86fa456d341fea132b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa803d33cac824eaf2bdcede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "分析气的流向，\r\n正确地施力……\r\n嗯，假想训练非常完美！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d45a527160fa1fec49a1ad0dd9a7e8dec7cf60bc689ea24082aba92dd39d9313",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d5d8abb6e468d415b46f58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练也很Happy☆Lucky☆\r\n因为大地和你的声音，\r\n会告诉我气的流向！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aabc0f6fa3784a88d38187574976aac6712a436eec46a7659dd3bedb3096bf08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37e390900de9a2e6a547ac98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "信者得救？不对，\r\n是相信并努力的人能够获得回报！\r\n就像我们这样☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc104645b74e679118c5286191fc4d45fa206e520d1df3662a8d73cd6086408b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb6070416b95f89c3a5f05ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员相信风水，并全力支持我！\r\n所以我绝对会用比赛的结果，\r\n让你变得happy！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64b13e941f390009406ec467e2390f8a624460cd8b3855926c06bd2d1e8b0008",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d87163f36d774b2c3b95aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真龙──这里的龙脉走势很不错，\r\n是个充满力量的地方，\r\n非常适合举办集训！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a298a87642efc93d1f1632853451f82300b0aff01ba8f7aada7a83e73bc8c97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56261262508be818c5fc4de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阴气和阳气，奔跑和休息。\n风水也好训练也好，\n中庸是最重要的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5571edf236eea47e6d31d599fbb872b1603d079d06b6d0659fc36a901d316aa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da925ebb1886848566d7695d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆\n全力冲刺☆\n大地的力量，我感受到了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dede70348fa3c5b29c3f41e5bca3e888a74003e60dfa393844fafcec72c7f04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:010ec5bf13de27d38185e66b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力量、体能、还有灵感！\n全都提升到了最棒的吉位，\n我都调查好了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "410a26f0dfc97b83b9b7d1b22416c49e64929c31547d9c6db5a655ec3bcb021f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33ee2f9eca341442829d49bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最重要的是心中的信念☆\n以风水为伙伴，注定会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a48116b04f5b170762c400220f0f04fbc5ce309c9c0fc516a73de6afe9aabe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3a56e7d6ae53c15eb6d542b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "静下心来倾听……听到了吧，\n由“气”演奏出来的旋律☆今天的\n训练选什么好可以告诉我一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0aebab71f8859a79423ff8a8af3a57d12704c936b59ccd1be6ffdf6c74830f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb982f1e3f353b2abb1048f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天你的声调是……嗯嗯！\n和往常一样，充满了希望！\n让气场和节奏合拍起来吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccd8b026452756b6bcc4ceb42bbd0b8abbcf2e0c93df5ee04fe6d1d4608f0013",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48a13db95dc77d13a566e6e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的气，还有你的声音……\n是共同跨越苦乐的灵魂旋律！\n简直就是最完美的和鸣呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dcacd81aa21689c4922f69b3eda95eeda3672b9dcc7a08733a0202712dfb297",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77dd8fd3dd2b5056cda2cc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们透过相生──\r\n实现了梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db56aeb5a4b485b9a281b355090652166d53b6e90d2d418c7825502ea8b0696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b57da24213e6026509a80846",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能走到今天这一步，\r\n真的是太happy了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc5b81a22f9ca0d93c75636f0d201374ad274f1f0cbdb8d22923822aed502ab9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7273e9abef0d076bc24286cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能和你共鸣，是我最大的幸福哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "006f9afa67d5a142f2aa1f20c68aaa950952302254d0d9ba9e2ec825dcd7bf53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db29b5711beabd0daa18f5da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这开运的和声☆\n是我们一起演奏的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a3cca4e692b6c16fb3e9cbd81a255e45355346fdadb378b41f0e9358a79d039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b64b08d33eb213921e2f1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的气聚集过来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e4b289e895005310d50f616f925da8bc753f2f963ee59b7c925d74d55cbd17b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26338e9fbe3b55f93de6a9d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆\r\n大、大、开运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6a115705b019a73d73de2bc120da1c709cf01b7a87a1af360286bbc6560d161",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9d12bff48378e199a4a9d50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是小林历奇！\r\n将为你带来幸运喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fff1c3a697e93ab2e6e929c89a951ea319343c531d37c022c11414a08861d0ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7d255fbed5c4b0a2238c0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "龙穴砂水──\r\n我听得见大地的「声音」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "166c333cf0f7ebcd9f07a3b68bf62704b3180505a30af3caa90a75562083a01f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d32ef7c7b6beacf7fd31dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来帮你开运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d1187233c7d0a3442c61df026bd6613db67213ca189fd2d706db9d2f2dc648",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8f60e676518b81cd64efbc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力量好像变强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85fa72336d8a3dfe2fcaff2f9fd5c6d8a4614b962ad615e0deb592f625c36cd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a886d84e1039226697fbc3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美好的未来，被照亮了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9fc0020ce343349a574b4233f807287e01c4ac78fc862fc794e881b9452bc38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa13669fd6abe49457697a42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听到了哦，这祝福的响声♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bad45ad62ec6aed63e75dbe023326a080d1312fd5b2452d7aac8a256d59345a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:955589b65b45793aeda29b4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阴阳五行的旋律♪\n奏响吧☆幸运的开场号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a536897c6e53a49ed4692b3149311d084ca5613bd557302633e74fc005596a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
